      "writtenOn": "2021-03-17T20:51:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Re Seek/Write: It\u0027s just immutability.  The object is immutable in the whole calling stack, and it doesn\u0027t have to be mutable.\n\nFileExt is an option, but it also requires implementing read_at.  It\u0027s more standard-ish but also broader than the current need.  I\u0027m not sure it\u0027s better.",
